@baseUrl = http://localhost:4001/products

### 1. Get all products
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. Get all products — filter by name
GET {{baseUrl}}?name=key

### 3. Get all products — sort by price (low to high)
GET {{baseUrl}}?sort=asc

### 4. Get all products — sort by price (high to low)
GET {{baseUrl}}?sort=desc

### 5. Get product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### 6. Get product — not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/999

### 7. Create a new product
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Headphones",
    "price": 79.99,
    "quantity": 8
}

### 8. Create product — missing fields (should 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "No Price Item"
}

### 9. Update product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
    "price": 89.99
}

### 10. Delete product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/2
